# Pico-dev toolchain

- Build, flash, and USB serial **only** via repo-root Make (`make help`). Do not install Pico SDK or `gcc-arm-none-eabi` on the host. Do not `cmake` outside the container. Do not `picotool load -f`.
- If a Pico is on USB, firmware work is **not done** until `make hello-test` (CDC `digest=`). No board (`make pico-discover` empty) is an explicit HIL skip, not a pass.
- Procedure: [`.cursor/skills/pico-dev-hil/SKILL.md`](../skills/pico-dev-hil/SKILL.md). Detail: [`docs/toolchains.md`](../../docs/toolchains.md).
